usage-left

The idea and the window layout (percent left, reset time, LOW under 15%) are
adapted from ribbon by Jay E / RoboNuggets
(https://github.com/robonuggets/ribbon), MIT License,
Copyright (c) 2026 Jay E | RoboNuggets (robonuggets.com).

Showing the last chat's windows until a new chat's first reply, and leaving
out any whose reset has passed, is adapted from a change proposed to ribbon
by Artem (BlackWizlock), robonuggets/ribbon#13.

Changes in 0.3.0: the row ends with the session's /cost total, and on an API
key it shows that cost alone. This is original to this repository, not taken
from ribbon.
